/// known-gap: interp ignores `stop` in a method called from a loop and returns nil
/// `stop` in a class method does not reach the caller's loop: R0405, not a crash.
<>C | n: 0
    act halt(i)
        if i == 2
            stop
        xx
        return i
    xx
xx
c <> C | n: 1
for i in [1, 2, 3]
    say(c.halt(i))
xx
say("after")
